ary>脊柱分节与弯曲示意</summary><p class="muted">观察 C1–C7、T1–T12、L1–L5。下面调整叠加在当前姿势上，皮肤、经穴与内部结构沿同一关节链随动。数值是教学设置，不是活动范围或临床角度。</p><label>观察哪一节<select id="spineLevel" aria-label="选择脊柱节段"></select></label><button id="focusSpine">在骨架中定位此节</button><p id="spineLevelInfo" role="status"></p><div class="spineInputs"><label>腰段前后屈 <output id="lumbarFlexValue"></output><input id="lumbarFlex" aria-label="腰段前后屈示意" type="range" min="-12" max="12" step="1" value="0"></label><label>腰段侧屈 <output id="lumbarSideValue"></output><input id="lumbarSide" aria-label="腰段侧屈示意" type="range" min="-12" max="12" step="1" value="0"></label><label>胸段前后屈 <output id="thoracicFlexValue"></output><input id="thoracicFlex" aria-label="胸段前后屈示意" type="range" min="-12" max="12" step="1" value="0"></label><label>胸段侧屈 <output id="thoracicSideValue"></output><input id="thoracicSide" aria-label="胸段侧屈示意" type="range" min="-12" max="12" step="1" value="0"></label><label>胸段转向 <output id="thoracicTwistValue"></output><input id="thoracicTwist" aria-label="胸段转向示意" type="range" min="-12" max="12" step="1" value="0"></label><label>颈段前后屈 <output id="cervicalFlexValue"></output><input id="cervicalFlex" aria-label="颈段前后屈示意" type="range" min="-12" max="12" step="1" value="0"></label><label>颈段侧屈 <output id="cervicalSideValue"></output><input id="cervicalSide" aria-label="颈段侧屈示意" type="range" min="-12" max="12" step="1" value="0"></label></div><button id="resetSpine">恢复当前姿势的原始设置</button><p id="spineNotice" class="muted"></p><details><summary>24 节对照数据</summary><div id="spineTable"></div></details><p class="muted">颈、胸、腰椎逐节旋转；肋骨按编号胸椎作刚体随动，肩带随上胸段、胸骨随中胸段。肋软骨与肋椎关节的真实运动和受力尚未求解。对照数据比较同一姿势在附加调整前后的骨块位置与方向；未测椎体终板，不是 Cobb 角。</p><p class="muted">保持时长不会自动把某节变成“受损”。结构性侧弯、椎间盘或神经问题需要临床检查和影像，当前模型不能判断哪一节有病变。</p><a href="https://www.srs.org/Patients/Diagnosis-And-Treatment/Diagnosing-Scoliosis" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SRS：侧弯怎样检查 ↗</a></details><small class="eyebrow">这个状态，身体在做什么</small><h2 id="analysisTitle">腰背为什么需要维持</h2><div class="focusButtons"><button data-focus="lumbar" aria-pressed="true">腰椎</button><button data-focus="neck">颈肩</button><button data-focus="knees">髋膝</button><button id="focusBody">看全身</button></div><p id="sceneExplanation" class="sceneExplanation"></p><div id="bodyAnalysis"></div><div class="durationPresets"><button data-minutes="0">0 分钟</button><button data-minutes="1">1 分钟</button><button data-minutes="10">10 分钟</button><button data-minutes="30">30 分钟</button><button data-minutes="60">60 分钟</button></div><div id="timeAnalysis"></div><section id="gravityObservation" aria-live="polite"></section><div class="gravityTools"><button id="gravityView">看重心与支撑</button><button id="segmentCenters" aria-pressed="false">显示分段质心</button></div><details><summary>参考分段参数与骨架对应</summary><div id="segmentTable"></div></details><details id="environment"><summary>改变观察条件</summary><div class="inputs"><label>身体质量 kg<input id="mass" type="number" min="20" max="200" value="70"></label><label id="loadLabel">物体质量 kg<input id="load" type="number" min="0" max="40" value="0"></label><label>持续分钟<input id="minutes" type="number" min="0" max="480" value="30"></label><label>计划换姿 / 换任务间隔（0为不安排）<input id="interval" type="number" min="0" max="120" value="20"></label></div><p id="loadContext" class="muted"></p><p id="loadNotice" role="status" class="muted"></p><label>重力 m/s²<input id="gravity" type="number" min="0" max="20" step=".01" value="9.81"></label><div class="environmentPresets"><button data-gravity="9.81">地球</button><button data-gravity="1.62">月球</button><button data-gravity="0">零重力</button></div><label id="waterRow" hidden>设定排水体积 L<input id="volume" type="number" min="0" max="200" value="65"></label><p id="inputError" role="alert"></p></details><details><summary>能算出的量与计算假设</summary><div id="numbers"></div></details><label class="comparePicker">对照生活场景<select id="compareChoice" aria-label="对照生活场景"></select></label><section id="comparison" hidden><h3>与上一个状态比较</h3><div id="comparisonBody"></div><button id="clearPin">清除对比</button></section><details><summary>依据与尚未求解的内容</summary><div id="sourceLinks"></div><p class="muted">男女模型采用共用参考关节链与各自可用原始结构，尚未个体校准。已接入体表、经穴与软组织的几何随动；未求解器官材料形变、神经张力、内部关节力或个人疲劳与损伤。需要个人尺寸、组织参数、真实动作和支撑反力数据才能继续这些求解。</p></details><button id="record">生成观察记录</button><p id="recordStatus" role="status"></p><details id="recordPreview" hidden><summary>查看记录</summary><textarea id="recordText" rows="10" readonly aria-label="观察记录 JSON"></textarea><a id="recordDownload" download>下载 JSON</a></details></aside></main>
